        "asr_text": "Not checking the phone does not prove that the alert had no effect. A brain recording found a larger signal during notification sounds. Researchers linked this to extra mental control: the mind had to keep the task going after the alert pulled at attention. A person may continue working, but the task can still require more effort in that moment.",
